{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32373","headline":"春日 · 温庭筠","name":"春日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问君何所思，迢递艳阳时。\n门静人归晚，墙高蝶过迟。\n一双青琐燕，千万绿杨丝。\n屏上吴山远，楼中朔管悲。\n宝书无寄处，香毂有来期。\n草色将林彩，相添入黛眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}